Z||000002||rockcrawl||04-01-2001||09:55 PM||||That's nothing! This weekend I met up with Eric_PA and we went to Harry's U-Pull-It to look at a Northstar he spotted a few weeks earlier. The Northstar was trashed, but we found some other great deals. I got a perfect dash and passenger seat from an '85 GT, $10 & $10. Two lighted rear view mirrors, $3 each. A Beretta Getrag, $60. 2.8 flywheel, $16. And the best part, a complete 4.5 PFI Cadillac V8 engine with harness and ECM for $50. All engines are $50 this week! We also located (3) 4.10 four speed transmisions. Thanks Eric for helping me pull that Getrag, I owe ya one!<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
