Z||000005||Fleabitdog||04-10-2001||07:31 PM||||I had a good week in the yards also. I picked up two wings, two GT tail lights, a tan passenger seat out of a 86 GT looks brand new. two pushbutton radios w/eq, have not checked them out yet, a perfect grant steering wheel, a grey leather wheel/with paddles very good condition, complete center console, set of grey visors complete set of body by fisher trim (gold) a set of dew wipes both sides look brand new a tan slider and amp 4 grey GT wheels (off 86 GT) gold 86 GT rear fascia very good condition complete set of the 88 dot matrix fascia for a 5 speed (other than aux gauges)tan leather auto shift knob I believe that is all. Not bad for about 300 bucks. God it's great to be back in Pa.<p>[This message has been edited by Fleabitdog (edited 04-10-2001).]||||reg||1
